codex
The failure is caused by this sandbox exposing `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`; Lean 4.22 queries the latter. I’ve isolated a minimal read-only compatibility shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`, and I’m validating the toolchain with it before rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight.
